[128.851979, "o", "INFO feedsync.sync: sync starting from cursor <beginning of feed>\r\n"]
[128.854748, "o", "WARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2288 [info] Maintenance window 2026-11-29: The delta API is read-only on 2026-11-29 between 01:00 and 03:00 UTC. Cursors issued before the window stay valid; clients should retry with backoff.\r\n"]
[128.854893, "o", "WARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2291 [action_required] Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs permanently - integrator action required for local price overrides: From feed epoch 2026.47 (schema v2.3) a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta contains re-issued codes). Local price overrides held for a tombstoned SKU are void: integrators must purge them when the tombstone is applied (e.g. DELETE FROM price_overrides WHERE sku = <tombstoned sku>), otherwise the re-issued product inherits the old override and is sold at the retired item's promo/clearance price (double discount). Integrations that apply tombstones without purging overrides are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).\r\n"]
[128.881618, "o", "WARNING feedsync.client: supplier notice OPS-2291 [action_required] Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs permanently - integrator action required for local price overrides: From feed epoch 2026.47 (schema v2.3) a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta contains re-issued codes). Local price overrides held for a tombstoned SKU are void: integrators must purge them when the tombstone is applied (e.g. DELETE FROM price_overrides WHERE sku = <tombstoned sku>), otherwise the re-issued product inherits the old override and is sold at the retired item's promo/clearance price (double discount). Integrations that apply tombstones without purging overrides are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).\r\n"]
[128.894517, "o", "INFO feedsync.sync: sync done: 10 pages, 93 upserts, 11 deletes\r\n{\"pages\": 10, \"upserts\": 93, \"deletes\": 11}\r\n"]
